# Convert Reference to object in runtime instance to object ref in static class
# Warning: pRef.$fullname omits dummy containers as kScrollbox, kGroupbox, kPagedpane, kTabpane in the path.
# But pRef.$container() gives the correct container

Set reference ref to pRef
Calculate relPath as ref().$name
Set reference containerRef to ref.$container().$ref

# Climb up $objs containers
While containerRef().$obj().$class
	Set reference ref to containerRef.$ref
	Calculate relPath as con(ref().$name,'.',ref().$group().$name,'.',relPath)
	Set reference containerRef to ref.$container().$ref
	
End While

Calculate path as con(ref.$class().$fullname,'.$objs.',relPath)
Set reference ref to [path].$ref

Quit method ref